    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join &quot;Magiscapes&quot;, an AI-driven sandbox adventure world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will build your camp from scratch and create your AI companions. The behavior of your companions is entirely driven by AI, so every interaction with them will deepen your shared memories and shape a unique relationship between you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to &quot;Magiscapes&quot; to experience the story you weave with your AI companions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Indispensable adventure journey</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having built your camp and collected equipment, the next step is to pack up and set off on an adventure. The Oz continent is filled with various magical creatures. Defeat them and leave your mark across the entire continent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990190/extras/472e498dd79b68e8e555248639c49b28.poster.avif?t=1752635778\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990190/extras/472e498dd79b68e8e555248639c49b28.webm?t=1752635778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990190/extras/472e498dd79b68e8e555248639c49b28.mp4?t=1752635778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI companions who can talk back</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The NPCs in &quot;Magiscapes&quot; are not just background characters. We have introduced AI technology to give life to NPCs. Try interacting with them more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990190/extras/a5ae3bd8db5e70f6fa3a713170070672.poster.avif?t=1752635778\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990190/extras/a5ae3bd8db5e70f6fa3a713170070672.webm?t=1752635778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990190/extras/a5ae3bd8db5e70f6fa3a713170070672.mp4?t=1752635778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One-click recruitment of your AI game companions!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try recruiting your favorite characters in the game by uploading pictures or entering descriptions. Each AI companion will have a unique appearance and story. Let your imagination run wild, and you might be pleasantly surprised?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990190/extras/d7158db641ae30037c874d65a998121e.avif?t=1752635778\" data-has-big width=800 height=502 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique relationships</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each NPC has their own unique personality and story. By interacting with them, you can develop unique special relationships and experience a rich social life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990190/extras/f0d3a475ccc7d1274686f2eab9be8919.avif?t=1752635778\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your camp</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Magiscapes&quot;, you play as a retired hero, starting from scratch to build your camp step by step. By collecting resources, constructing facilities, and developing agriculture, your camp will gradually prosper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990190/extras/1d0910a6a898c40c235373a1e8eae05f.avif?t=1752635778\" width=616 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About demo version</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the demo version, players can experience the Plains Map and the Cave Map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The maps contain four NPCs, and players can recruit one AI NPC.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo version includes a beginner's process and some early tasks.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join &quot;Magiscapes&quot;, an AI-driven sandbox adventure world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will build your camp from scratch and create your AI companions. The behavior of your companions is entirely driven by AI, so every interaction with them will deepen your shared memories and shape a unique relationship between you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to &quot;Magiscapes&quot; to experience the story you weave with your AI companions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Indispensable adventure journey</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having built your camp and collected equipment, the next step is to pack up and set off on an adventure. The Oz continent is filled with various magical creatures. Defeat them and leave your mark across the entire continent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990190/extras/472e498dd79b68e8e555248639c49b28.poster.avif?t=1752635778\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990190/extras/472e498dd79b68e8e555248639c49b28.webm?t=1752635778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990190/extras/472e498dd79b68e8e555248639c49b28.mp4?t=1752635778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI companions who can talk back</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The NPCs in &quot;Magiscapes&quot; are not just background characters. We have introduced AI technology to give life to NPCs. Try interacting with them more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990190/extras/a5ae3bd8db5e70f6fa3a713170070672.poster.avif?t=1752635778\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990190/extras/a5ae3bd8db5e70f6fa3a713170070672.webm?t=1752635778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990190/extras/a5ae3bd8db5e70f6fa3a713170070672.mp4?t=1752635778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One-click recruitment of your AI game companions!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try recruiting your favorite characters in the game by uploading pictures or entering descriptions. Each AI companion will have a unique appearance and story. Let your imagination run wild, and you might be pleasantly surprised?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990190/extras/d7158db641ae30037c874d65a998121e.avif?t=1752635778\" data-has-big width=800 height=502 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique relationships</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each NPC has their own unique personality and story. By interacting with them, you can develop unique special relationships and experience a rich social life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990190/extras/f0d3a475ccc7d1274686f2eab9be8919.avif?t=1752635778\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your camp</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Magiscapes&quot;, you play as a retired hero, starting from scratch to build your camp step by step. By collecting resources, constructing facilities, and developing agriculture, your camp will gradually prosper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990190/extras/1d0910a6a898c40c235373a1e8eae05f.avif?t=1752635778\" width=616 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About demo version</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the demo version, players can experience the Plains Map and the Cave Map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The maps contain four NPCs, and players can recruit one AI NPC.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo version includes a beginner's process and some early tasks.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to Magiscapes, the world's first AI sandbox adventure! Build your camp, create AI companions, and form unique bonds through interactions. Embark on a journey of discovery and enjoy the freedom to explore!",
